   [del.]

   floating eye, nymph, gnome with wand of sleep, black pudding, air elemental,
   Olog-Hai, minotaur, black dragon, master lich, Archon, Angel.

After a certain point almost nothing can harm you. Among the few exceptions
are krakens or eels that can drown you, shades that take your speed away,
magic using monsters that make your armor explode and so on.

In the lower levels there are of course monsters that you wouldn't want to
meet. :-)

I wouldn't mention nymphs in that list, because the great majority of them is
asleep. And black puddings occur imho only from those levels on where you are
experienced enough to deal with them.

The most dangerous monsters for low level characters are ihmo:

1) floating eye
2) soldier ant
3) orc horde  (You know the situation: "Just one stinkin' hill orc ... hehe")
4) mumak
5) rothe (as orcs, they tend to attack you in groups)

